  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0d822886221c0364b9fc056e41f01c23, type: 3}
  m_Name: 3_ConstructionRoom
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Tutorial
  ID: 2
  Message:
  - '<color=#FFFF00>Construction Room</color> has a yellow panel which can be used
    to construct Machines. '
  - Machines take a resource as an input and produce an output based on the input
    resource.
  - Machines are more efficient in crafting advanced resources as compared to the
    workbench in <color=#CC8C4C>Mechanic Room</color>
  - Machines can only be placed on the surface and not in the bunker, so dont forget
    to add some machines in your inventory before going to the surface. Also most
    of the machines consume electricity to function.
